    "description": "Official Demo Collection for Contribution 3 (REST Endpoints & Relational JOIN).\nDeveloper: M.SHIVARAM (252U1R5104)\nClass: 313 AI DE 2B | Group: YG-AIDE2B-G08\nFaculty: Mr Yugandhar Gurjalwar\nIncludes complete CRUD for Doctors, Rooms, Bookings, and the relational SQL JOIN endpoint.",
